Abbasi et al., 2025 – “A Practical Performance Benchmark of Post-Quantum Cryptography Across Heterogeneous Computing Environments” (Cryptography)
They present cross-platform benchmarks of Kyber, NTRU, BIKE, Dilithium, Falcon, etc., and report raw operation times (in ms) as tables for particular hardware environments (Server E1, Laptop E2, Device E3). See Tables 3–5: “Raw operation times (ms) at NIST Security Levels 1, 3, and 5.” 
