Tzinos et al., 2022 – “Evaluating the performance of post-quantum secure algorithms in the TLS protocol” (JSSS)
Their “third experiment: raw performance” uses liboqs’ speed_kem and reports mean execution times for keygen, encaps, and decaps (in ms) for McEliece, Kyber, NTRU, Saber variants on two specific CPUs, in Tables 2–5. 
