Sikeridis et al., 2020 – “Post-Quantum Authentication in TLS 1.3: A Performance Study” (NDSS)
They integrate PQ signatures into TLS 1.3 and then give tables of mean and standard deviation of sign/verify times (in ms) on a local machine and cloud instances (Table II), plus handshake latency CDF plots for a particular client–server setup. 
